					<h1 class="title" title="Vijayvada City Trip">Vijayawada City Trip</h1>
					<div class="entry-content">
    <p>

    <b>Altitude : </b>125 metres.
        <img alt="Undavalli Caves" title="Undavalli Caves"  class="thumb alignright" style="height:150px; width:200px; float:right" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/vijaiwada/vijayawada.jpg" /></p>
